      "Pinned PyTorch contiguous Linear flattens to addmm and initializes bias before MKL SGEMM; Candle uses a different GEMM reduction and adds bias afterward",
      "Frozen block 2 projected logits span approximately -95578 to 4859, amplifying low-order projection differences; changing only Q/K/V in official attention reproduces the observed attention error",
